{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1849","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"F. XOR Partition"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"7 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"512 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For a set of integers $$$S$$$, let's define its cost as the minimum value of $$$x \\oplus y$$$ among all pairs of "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"different"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" integers from the set (here, $$$\\oplus$$$ denotes bitwise XOR). If there are less than two elements in the set, its cost is equal to $$$2^{30}$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given a set of integers $$$\\{a_1, a_2, \\dots, a_n\\}$$$. You have to partition it into two sets $$$S_1$$$ and $$$S_2$$$ in such a way that every element of the given set belongs to exactly one of these two sets. The value of the partition is the "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"minimum"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" among the costs of $$$S_1$$$ and $$$S_2$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Find the partition with the "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"maximum"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" possible value."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains $$$n$$$ ($$$2 \\le n \\le 200000$$$) — the number of elements in the set."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains $$$n$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"distinct"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" integers $$$a_1$$$, $$$a_2$$$, ..., $$$a_n$$$ ($$$0 \\le a_i \\lt 2^{30}$$$) — the elements of the set."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print a string $$$n$$$ characters "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" and/or "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" describing the partition as follows: the $$$i$$$-th character should be "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if the element $$$a_i$$$ belongs to $$$S_1$$$, otherwise, that character should be "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If there are multiple optimal answers, print any of them."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"5\n42 13 1337 37 152\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"10001\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4\n1 2 3 4\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"1100\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2\n1 2\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"10\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"8\n7 6 5 4 3 2 1 0\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"10010110\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"F","problemCode":"1849F","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1849/problem/F"}